@startuml
left to right direction
title C4 level 1 — Contact the program — system context
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "Anonymous visitor\n[Person]" as primary #E0F2FE
actor "Program staff\n[Person]" as staff #E0F2FE
rectangle "Word Up software system\n[Software system]\nYouth leadership, learning, mentoring, and program operations" as wordup #D1FADF
rectangle "Email delivery service\n[External software system]" as ext1 #FFF4E5
primary --> wordup : An anonymous visitor starts the contact the program interaction through…
staff --> wordup : Administers authorized program activity
wordup --> ext1 : Exchanges email delivery data
legend right
  |= Element |= C4 meaning |
  | Person | Human role outside the software boundary |
  | Software system | Word Up entity of interest |
  | External software system | Independently operated dependency |
endlegend
@enduml
